",null,{"className":"episode-glance","aria-labelledby":"episode-glance-title","children":[["$","h2",null,{"id":"episode-glance-title","children":"Episode at a glance"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"battle-facts","children":[["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","span",null,{"children":"Period covered"}],["$","strong",null,{"children":"May 19–23, 1864"}]]}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","span",null,{"children":"Location"}],["$","strong",null,{"children":"Spotsylvania Court House to the North Anna River and Hanover Junction, Virginia"}]]}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","span",null,{"children":"Historical context"}],["$","strong",null,{"children":"Grant’s attempt to draw Lee into attacking an isolated II Corps failed; Lee recognized the general movement and withdrew directly to the North Anna, where the armies prepared for another engagement"}]]}]]}],false,["$","div",null,{"className":"glance-forces","children":[["$","h3",null,{"children":"Forces and losses"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"glance-scope","children":"Reported figures retain the scope and estimates of the existing guide. They may cover different units or periods; missing breakdowns are not inferred."}],["$","table",null,{"children":[["$","caption",null,{"children":"Figures reported in this guide"}],["$","thead",null,{"children":["$","tr",null,{"children":[["$","th",null,{"scope":"col","children":"Scope"}],["$","th",null,{"scope":"col","children":"Reported figure"}]]}]}],["$","tbody",null,{"children":[["$","tr","U.S. Harris Farm casualties",{"children":[["$","th",null,{"scope":"row","children":"U.S. Harris Farm casualties"}],["$","td",null,{"children":["About 1,500","$undefined"]}]]}],["$","tr","Confederate Harris Farm casualties",{"children":[["$","th",null,{"scope":"row","children":"Confederate Harris Farm casualties"}],["$","td",null,{"children":["About 900","$undefined"]}]]}]]}]]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"glance-sources","children":[["$","a","https://civilwarpodcast.org/2025/05/05/civil-war-podc